# live batch 2 item 2: calibration PROBE rungs (owner 2026-10-08: row 10kg x15
# @RIR4+ gave no load information; a second, heavier rung was right). On an
# ESTIMATED working weight a loaded rung asks RIR. A rung is INFORMATIVE when
